==Irish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ga|sga|les|t=the space about a dwelling-house or houses enclosed by a bank or rampart}}. Cognate with {{cog|cy|llys}} and {{cog|br|lez}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|ga|/l̠ʲɪsˠ/|/l̠ʲʊsˠ/}}

===Noun===
{{ga-noun|m|leasa|~anna}}

# enclosed ground of (ancient) [[dwelling]]-house; [[enclosed]] space, [[garth]]
# [[ringfort]]
# [[fairy mound]]
# [[ring]], [[halo]]

====Declension====
{{ga-decl-m3|l|ios|easa|iosanna}}

